{
 "clinical_assessment": "The patient is currently taking cholestyramine, a bile acid sequestrant, and is prescribed doxepin, a tricyclic antidepressant. The key hazard is the known drug-drug interaction between cholestyramine and many drugs, including doxepin. Cholestyramine binds to tetracyclic drugs in the gastrointestinal tract, reducing their absorption and systemic exposure.",
